custom_minimum_size = Vector2(1, 0)
layout_mode = 2
text = "So, it looks like someone has a crush on you.
\"Diego likes you, you know. He just doesn't have the guts to tell you.
You probably see him as that weirdo who speaks a strange language and treats you like dirt. And that’s true. But in the break room, all we hear are good things about you. He admires your intelligence; he thinks you’re essential to our team. You’re the only one who’s come this far, and he knows it.
Diego’s a good guy—he even wants to have a kid with you! But don’t tell him that; he wants to keep it a secret.
Despite his hater, tough-guy persona, he loves you. He even left you a little message full of hope for your future at URSSAF.
All the pleasure is yours.\"
- John Doe"
autowrap_mode = 3

